ally sitting here eating pizza this  is i feel like the world's biggest  failure because i feel like i'm just  kind of right back to the past and the  sense of my face is like getting bigger  again i'm eating foods that cause  inflammation i am so stressed out i just  want comfort food like i'm not eating a  lot like i'm only eating like twice a  day right now because i go from being so  stressed that i can't eat too all of a  sudden when i am hungry all i want is  carbs all i want is cheese and pizza so  it's one thing to give yourself  permission to eat food which i fully  support but pairing that with guilt and  shame will only kick the emotional  roller coaster into high gear this  sounds like a really stressful time for  jaclyn and maybe it's a time that we  actually need to be focusing on exercise  and compassion  rather than calling ourselves a failure  or loser i think it's really hard to be  a creator and share all of these  vulnerable moments with fans on the  internet but i also think that this  content and looking at it and reviewing  it objectively might be a really great  opportunity for jacqueline like if it  were a best friend saying all these  things what would you tell her how would  you convince her that she's not a  failure that she's not a loser and that  eating the pizza and resting is maybe  the best thing that she can be doing for  herself right now as for the scenario of  losing her appetite only then to kind of  later overeat comfort foods this is not  an uncommon pattern if this sounds like  you i recommend setting alarms for  yourself every few hours to sit down for  a meal or snack even if nothing sounds  particularly good to you pre-plan out  some simple tolerable options that can  at least fuel your body and mind this at  least helps deal with the physical  hunger piece which typically makes the  psychological hunger less noisy and  desperate it also helps prevent those  spikes in cortisol which can actually  just perpetuate those nega